        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D9002, 1-3/4 Inch Bore Hole Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bore.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"232\" height=\"194\" border=\"0\" align= \"right\" alt=\"1 3/4 inch door bore hole diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a high security heavy duty stainless steel deadbolt from Omnia for a <b>1-1/2\" to 1-3/4\" Bore Hole</b>. This 2 Inch Diameter Stainless Steel Deadbolt is available in either single cylinder or double cylinder functions. The Stainless Steel Deadbolt for small Bore Hole has a brushed stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-1460-arms.jpg?v=1704354689\" width=\"600\" height=\"237\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia D9002A Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia D9002 Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>High security 1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Fits 1-1/2\" to 1-3/4\" diameter Bore Hole.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinders with collar, 1 thumbturn, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, reinforced armored strike with 3\" long screws, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Brushed Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Side Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Side Overall Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor <b>1-3/4\" Bore Hole.</b> It will NOT fit a door with the standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole.\r\n</p>",
