                "description": "Omnia D9002 Deadbolt. Omnia Stainless Steel Deadbolt Fits in 1 3/4 inch bore hole,  \r\n Brushed Stainless Steel Finish. Available as Single Cylinder (Keyed lock on the outside with thumbturn inside) or Double Cylinder (Keyed lock on both the outside and inside).\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-D9002 Stainless Steel Deadbolt 1-3/4 Inch Bore Holes, Omnia  D9002 Stainless Steel Deadbolts, stainless steel dead bolt,  Stainless Steel  single cylinder deadbolts, Stainless Steel  double cylinder deadbolts,  omnia deadbolts, d9002a38.38, d9002a34.38, d9002a38.34, d9002a34.34, d9002ac38.38, d9002ac34.38, d9002ac38.34, d9002ac34.34,"
